# Code Intelligence knowledge graph cache -- a serialized build artifact
# that bakes in absolute filesystem paths resolved at build time (every
# Model node's filepaths). Committing it lets one machine's absolute paths
# silently overwrite another machine's on checkout -- see todo/contexte.txt
# for the real incident this caused (analyze_security_locks and friends
# returning nothing for every model, on any machine that doesn't match
# whoever last built/committed this file). Always regenerate locally via
# scripts/rebuild_graph.py instead of relying on a committed copy.
code_intelligence/active_graph.json
code_intelligence/full_corpus_test/